## Non-negotiable Constraints for the Agent

- Use `cryptography` (Python) and native `WebCrypto` (browser) only — no custom/home-grown crypto.
- Never embed a static/hardcoded key in the JS bundle.
- Always tie key lifecycle to server-side session state so logout truly invalidates it.
- Every public-facing doc (README, docstrings, package description) must include the threat-model caveat in plain language.
- Default client storage mode should be `sessionStorage`, not `localStorage`.